We have not observed any instabilities in the numerical approximation of system~\eqref{eq.SV} due to the use of sharp low-pass filter  for any of the initial data we tested satisfying \(1+\eta_0>0\). Just as in the case of dimension one, we observe instabilities when violating the non-cavitation assumption \(1+\eta_0>0\) for the sharp low-pass filter, but not the smooth low-pass filter, see Figure~\ref{fig.2D_zerodepth}.

