In the following, we introduce ASNs and how every element of the ASP-Core-2 language~\cite{ASP-Core-2} can, by our neural-compilation process, be translated into an equivalent RG.
Afterward, we explain how truth value propagation via message passing is used to obtain the stable models from the RG.

