\section*{Impact Statement}
%
This paper aims to enhance the efficiency of machine learning and expand the accessibility of large language models.
%
We find that the accuracy degradation is not negligible.
%
Despite this, the performance trade-off is acceptable given the significant improvements in latency and resource efficiency. 
%
Our work enables large language models to be deployed on resource-limited devices.
%
As a positive feature, our method may push the development of privacy-centric on-device applications, where sensitive data can be processed locally without relying on cloud services.
%
However, our work may also present challenges such as increased device resource usage and potential security vulnerabilities if the local devices are compromised.

