\subsection{Economic Viability of Fair Lending}

While all models were unprofitable under the default economic parameters, our sensitivity analysis revealed conditions where fair lending becomes economically viable.

% Figure 3: Economic Parameters Impact
\begin{figure}[H]
\centering
\includegraphics[width=0.9\columnwidth]{economic_viability_analysis.png}
