All experiments in this paper were conducted using Python on a MacBook Pro with an Apple M3 processor and 24GB of RAM. For the FuncVul implementation, a batch size of 8 was used with a chunk code embedding vector length of 512. The model was trained for 3 epochs with 50 warmup steps, a weight decay of 0.05, and automatic reloading of the best model at the end.


