This study focuses on vulnerability detection strategies, without considering multi-class detection since vulnerabilities have varying risk levels. Future work will extend to multi-class vulnerability detection to address risk variations. Currently, we identify vulnerabilities in C/C++ and Python code, with plans to expand to other programming languages.

