Generic code chunks converts code chunks in generic format. Here, we use the following LLM to convert the generic code chunk as described in Table \ref{tab:generic_prompt}. Table \ref{tab:generic_prompt} also shows the one example of code chunk and converted generic code chunk based on the proposed LLM generic prompt.




