        \textbf{Description of Generic Prompt}\\ \midrule
           Here is the function code chunk: $\{code\_chunk\}$

            Please convert the code chunk by renaming functions to $F_1, F_2, ..., F_N$ and variables to $v_1, v_2, ..., v_n$. 

