\subsubsection{Compression efficiency}
In Fig.~\ref{fig:comparison_compressors} we illustrate the impact of the compression configuration on the encoded file size. We use boxplots, where the black line inside each box indicates the median, the box edges correspond to the 25th and 75th percentiles, and the whiskers denote the outliers. 
