%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%%
The remainder of this paper is organized as follows. In Section~\ref{Sec:2}, we describe the governing equations and their derivation based on non-equilibrium thermodynamics. Section~\ref{Sec:3} presents the details of the finite element implementation, including discretization strategies. Section~\ref{Sec:4} provides validation and benchmark results for the developed solver and model performance while Section~\ref{Sec:5} presents the results and discussion in details. Finally, Section~\ref{Sec:6} summarizes our findings and suggests potential future directions for extending this work.


