    \caption{\label{fig_phase} Reconstruction of the wave function \( u(\x, k) \) on \( \Gamma \) with \( k = \overline{k} \), showing both real and imaginary parts from magnitude-only data. The data in (a) corresponds to Test 1 with a noise level of 10\%.}
