\]

where the kernel $K(t,\tau;\lambda)$ allows dynamic weighting of past gradients and $\lambda$ evolves according to data volatility:
\[
\frac{d\lambda}{dt} = \eta \cdot \frac{\partial \mathcal{L}_{\text{meta}}}{\partial \lambda}
\]

