 \emph{Discretize+RBM}. As $h$ decreases, the discretize+RBM scheme not only speeds up computational time but may also deliver higher accuracy. However, this trend does not necessarily hold for smaller $h$, as observed, for instance, in \Cref{tab:memory}, where at $h=0.003$ the RBM accuracy, while still close, falls slightly below that of the full-graph solution.

