Digital Twins hold great potential to personalize clinical patient care, provided the concept is translated to meet specific requirements dictated by established clinical workflows.
We present a generalizable Digital Twin design combining knowledge graphs and ensemble learning to reflect the entire patient’s clinical journey and assist clinicians in their decision-making.
