Then $\phi_s$ will be defined as 
$\Arena \; \wedgebar \; \pi_s$ and $\phi_b$ will be defined as $\pi_b \; \wedgebar \; \zetaup_b \; \wedgebar \; \delta_b$.

In Section \ref{pieces-together} we will show that the equivalence 
$\spadesuit 
\; 
\Leftrightarrow
