%     \item can our wrist be attached to Franka or the UR? 
%     \item Import this wrist into simulation and train a sim2real policy. 
%     \item Characterize dynamic properties of the actual wrist that we manufactured. We have desired properties and the properties from the design before manufacturing -- but what about after manufacturing? 
