The theoretical results in this paper extend to tensors of  arbitrary order $m\geq2$, where transportation of data from the boundary arc $\Lambda$ to the inner  chord $L$ can be done at each of the sweep down steps in the method in \cite{fujiwaraOmogbheSadiqTamasan23}.
